{"id":46796,"date":"2025-11-23T19:40:33","date_gmt":"2025-11-23T18:40:33","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=46796"},"modified":"2026-08-23T17:20:56","modified_gmt":"2026-08-23T16:20:56","slug":"sao-silvestre-de-vila-nova-de-tazem","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-de-vila-nova-de-tazem\/","title":{"rendered":"S\u00e3o Silvestre de Vila Nova de Tazem 2025"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"46796\" class=\"elementor elementor-46796 elementor-bc-flex-widget\" data-elementor-post-type=\"ajde_events\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0f93804 e-con-full e-flex e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"0f93804\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c4fdbf1 elementor-widget elementor-widget-html\" data-id=\"c4fdbf1\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"html.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<!-- IN\u00cdCIO BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL: S\u00c3O SILVESTRE DE VILA NOVA DE TAZEM 2025 -->\n<div class=\"pr-page-wrapper\" style=\"max-width: 1140px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px 16px 60px 16px; box-sizing: border-box; overflow-x: hidden;\">\n    \n    <!-- M\u00d3DULO 1: SOBRE O EVENTO -->\n    <div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n        <h2 style=\"font-family: Outfit, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n            Sobre a <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre de Vila Nova de Tazem 2025<\/span>\n        <\/h2>\n        <p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n            A <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre de Vila Nova de Tazem 2025<\/strong> celebra a 1.\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o desta grande iniciativa desportiva no concelho de Gouveia, integrada no cen\u00e1rio ic\u00f3nico das serras do distrito da Guarda. Realizada no s\u00e1bado, 27 de dezembro de 2025, a prova re\u00fane centenas de atletas e caminheiros para percorrerem as ruas iluminadas e animadas da vila de Tazem.\n        <\/p>\n        <p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n            O tra\u00e7ado combina o esp\u00edrito festivo da quadra natal\u00edcia com o desafio f\u00edsico do piso urbano em paralelos e asfalto. Para gerir o esfor\u00e7o nas rampas do sop\u00e9 da Serra da Estrela, utiliza a nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline; font-weight: 600;\" target=\"_blank\">calculadora de pace e ritmos de corrida<\/a>.\n        <\/p>\n    <\/div>\n\n    <!-- M\u00d3DULO 2: \u26a1 FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT -->\n    <div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n        <h2 style=\"font-family: Outfit, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n            \u26a1 Ficha T\u00e9cnica da Prova\n        <\/h2>\n        <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr)); gap: 16px;\">\n            <div style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5); padding: 16px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\">\n                <div style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 4px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 Data Oficial da 1.\u00aa Edi\u00e7\u00e3o<\/div>\n                <div style=\"color: #FFF; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700;\">27 de Dezembro de 2025<\/div>\n            <\/div>\n            <div style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5); padding: 16px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\">\n                <div style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 4px;\">\ud83d\udccd Localiza\u00e7\u00e3o<\/div>\n                <div style=\"color: #FFF; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700;\">Vila Nova de Tazem (Gouveia, Guarda)<\/div>\n            <\/div>\n            <div style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5); padding: 16px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\">\n                <div style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 4px;\">\ud83d\udccf Dist\u00e2ncias<\/div>\n                <div style=\"color: #FFF; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700;\">Corrida 10K \/ 5K & Caminhada<\/div>\n            <\/div>\n            <div style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5); padding: 16px; border-radius: 12px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);\">\n                <div style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 4px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Tipo de Piso<\/div>\n                <div style=\"color: #FFF; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700;\">Asfalto e Cal\u00e7ada Urbana<\/div>\n            <\/div>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/div>\n\n    <!-- M\u00d3DULO 3: \ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f GEOMETRIA DA PROVA & PERCURSO -->\n    <div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n        <h2 style=\"font-family: Outfit, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n            \ud83c\udfd4\ufe0f Geometria da Prova & Percurso\n        <\/h2>\n        <p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n            O tra\u00e7ado da <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre de Vila Nova de Tazem 2025<\/strong> desenvolve-se pelas principais art\u00e9rias da vila, proporcionando um ambiente festivo com forte apoio popular nas ruas. O perfil altim\u00e9trico apresenta oscila\u00e7\u00f5es constantes com pequenas subidas e descidas caracter\u00edsticas das zonas urbanas do sop\u00e9 da serra.\n        <\/p>\n        <p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n            A altern\u00e2ncia entre o asfalto r\u00e1pido e os tro\u00e7os de cal\u00e7ada urbana exige aten\u00e7\u00e3o na ader\u00eancia e na cad\u00eancia de passada, especialmente se as temperaturas de dezembro no distrito da Guarda trouxerem humidade noturna.\n        <\/p>\n    <\/div>\n\n    <!-- M\u00d3DULO 4: \u23f1\ufe0f BANNER DA CALCULADORA DE PACE -->\n    <div class=\"pr-calc-event-banner\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.15) 0%, rgba(109, 40, 217, 0.25) 100%); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 20px; padding: 24px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n        <h3 style=\"font-family: Outfit, sans-serif; font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFF; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n            Calcula os teus Tempos de Passagem para Vila Nova de Tazem\n        <\/h3>\n        <p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 16px;\">\n            Define o teu ritmo ideal por quil\u00f3metro e descobre o tempo previsto de chegada \u00e0 meta.\n        <\/p>\n        <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8B5CF6 0%, #6D28D9 100%); color: #FFF; font-weight: 800; border-radius: 20px; padding: 10px 24px; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block; font-family: Outfit, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\" target=\"_blank\">\n            Aceder \u00e0 Calculadora de Pace \u2197\n        <\/a>\n    <\/div>\n\n    <!-- M\u00d3DULO 5: \ud83c\udfe8 ONDE FICAR -->\n    <div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n        <h2 style=\"font-family: Outfit, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n            \ud83c\udfe8 Onde Ficar em Vila Nova de Tazem e Gouveia\n        <\/h2>\n        <p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n            A vila de Tazem e o concelho de Gouveia oferecem excelentes alojamentos de turismo rural, quintas hist\u00f3ricas e hot\u00e9is de montanha acolhedores. A proximidade a Seia e \u00e0 Serra da Estrela permite combinar a participa\u00e7\u00e3o na prova com um fim de semana de descanso e natureza.\n        <\/p>\n        <p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n            Recomenda-se a reserva antecipada de alojamento, dada a elevada procura tur\u00edstica da regi\u00e3o durante a quadra natal\u00edcia e de fim de ano.\n        <\/p>\n    <\/div>\n\n    <!-- M\u00d3DULO 6: \ud83c\udf0d SOBRE O LOCAL & GASTRONOMIA REGIONAL -->\n    <div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n        <h2 style=\"font-family: Outfit, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n            \ud83c\udf0d Sobre Vila Nova de Tazem & Gastronomia\n        <\/h2>\n        <p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 14px;\">\n            Vila Nova de Tazem \u00e9 reconhecida pela sua forte tradi\u00e7\u00e3o vitivin\u00edcola na Sub-Regi\u00e3o da Serra da Estrela (Regi\u00e3o Demarcada do D\u00e3o) e pela riqueza do seu patrim\u00f3nio natural. A gastronomia da regi\u00e3o de Gouveia destaca o consagrado Queijo da Serra da Estrela, o borrego assado, os enchidos tradicionais e os vinhos do D\u00e3o.\n        <\/p>\n        <p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n            Ap\u00f3s cortar a meta na S\u00e3o Silvestre, nada melhor do que repor energias com uma ceia tradicional de montanha e apreciar a hospitalidade beir\u00e3.\n        <\/p>\n    <\/div>\n\n    <!-- M\u00d3DULO 7: \u2753 SEC\u00c7\u00c3O DE PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) -->\n    <section class=\"pr-faq-section\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px;\">\n        <h2 class=\"pr-section-title\" style=\"font-family: Outfit, sans-serif; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: #FFFFFF; margin-bottom: 8px;\">\n            Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes<\/span>\n        <\/h2>\n        <p class=\"pr-section-subtitle\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 14px; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\n            Respostas \u00e0s principais d\u00favidas sobre a S\u00e3o Silvestre de Vila Nova de Tazem 2025.\n        <\/p>\n\n        <div class=\"pr-faq-grid\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px;\">\n            <details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px;\">\n                <summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFF; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; cursor: pointer; list-style: none;\">\n                    Onde posso consultar os Resultados da S\u00e3o Silvestre de Vila Nova de Tazem 2025?\n                <\/summary>\n                <div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 10px; line-height: 1.6;\">\n                    Assim que forem homologadas pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o, as classifica\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais e p\u00f3dios ser\u00e3o disponibilizados na caixa de resultados desta p\u00e1gina e nos portais de cronometragem associados.\n                <\/div>\n            <\/details>\n\n            <details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px;\">\n                <summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFF; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; cursor: pointer; list-style: none;\">\n                    Onde encontro as Fotos Oficiais da prova de 2025?\n                <\/summary>\n                <div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 10px; line-height: 1.6;\">\n                    As galerias de fotografia do evento e cobertura fotogr\u00e1fica dos atletas s\u00e3o disponibilizadas atrav\u00e9s das p\u00e1ginas oficiais da organiza\u00e7\u00e3o e nas redes sociais do Portugal Running.\n                <\/div>\n            <\/details>\n\n            <details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.5); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 16px;\">\n                <summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFF; font-weight: 700; font-size: 15px; cursor: pointer; list-style: none;\">\n                    Qual \u00e9 o tipo de piso do percurso?\n                <\/summary>\n                <div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 14px; margin-top: 10px; line-height: 1.6;\">\n                    O percurso desenha-se em piso urbano de asfalto e tro\u00e7os em paralelos no centro hist\u00f3rico da vila de Tazem, com ondula\u00e7\u00f5es moderadas.\n                <\/div>\n            <\/details>\n        <\/div>\n    <\/section>\n\n<\/div>\n<!-- FIM BLOCO REUTILIZ\u00c1VEL -->\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":46797,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"elementor_header_footer","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,27,28,47],"event_type_2":[212,726],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-46796","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-vila-nova-de-tazem-gouveia","event_type-caminhada","event_type-corrida","event_type-corrida-10-km","event_type-sao-silvestre","event_type_2-guarda","event_type_2-porto-e-norte"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/SSILVESTRE_VNT_25_Cartaz.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/46796","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=46796"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/46796\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":61350,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/46796\/revisions\/61350"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/46797"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=46796"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=46796"},{"taxonomy":"event_type","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type?post=46796"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_2","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_2?post=46796"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_3","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_3?post=46796"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_4","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_4?post=46796"},{"taxonomy":"event_type_5","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event_type_5?post=46796"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}